@host = http://localhost:8000

### Items with pagination defaults
GET {{host}}/items

### Items with explicit pagination
GET {{host}}/items?limit=5&offset=10

### Search with tags
GET {{host}}/search?q=laptop&tag=apple&tag=m3

### 401 — missing api key
GET {{host}}/secret

### 200 — with api key
GET {{host}}/secret
X-API-Key: secret-key

### admin router — 401 without key
GET {{host}}/admin/stats

### admin router — 200 with key
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
X-API-Key: secret-key
